: {"version": 1, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "29258809760405347"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "29007754548844204"}, "id": "29258809760405347", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": true, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "29007754548844204", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1499579856565179"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1844754896775865", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Levanter", "keywords": ["oleadas", "shooter", "robots", "drones", "mechas"], "long_description": "El Mandato, un ej\u00e9rcito enmascarado que no responde ante nadie, toma la costa pueblo a pueblo. Los \u00faltimos vecinos huyen y alguien debe aguantar la l\u00ednea hasta que se vayan.\n\nLevanter es un shooter VR de supervivencia por oleadas, duro y f\u00edsico. T\u00fa y dos compa\u00f1eros resist\u00eds doce oleadas cada vez m\u00e1s duras. Sobrevive a todas.\n\nLUCHA CON TODO EL CUERPO\n- Fusiles, carabinas y subfusiles t\u00e9rmicos, escopeta, lanza de carga y magnum. Un arma ligera en cada mano.\n- Recarga alzando el arma, lanza granadas y golpea cuerpo a cuerpo en movimiento.\n- Salta, enciende el jetpack y planea desde las azoteas.\n\nCONOCE LO QUE VIENE\n- Soldados enmascarados que se cubren, te inmovilizan y te flanquean.\n- Androides de combate, perros robot, enjambres de drones, caminantes y mechas pesados llegan por tierra y aire.\n\nAGUANTA LA POSICI\u00d3N\n- Gana cr\u00e9ditos con cada baja y g\u00e1stalos en el centro de control entre oleadas.\n- Levanta defensas, usa armas pesadas y reanima a un compa\u00f1ero ca\u00eddo cogi\u00e9ndole de la mano.\n- Cuatro dificultades, de RECRUIT a LEGEND.\n\nCOMODIDAD\nMovimiento libre, giro por pasos o continuo, sentado o de pie, campo de visi\u00f3n completo. Modo zurdo, subt\u00edtulos, punto de mira y punter\u00eda estable.\n\nACCESO ANTICIPADO\nLevanter est\u00e1 en pleno desarrollo y seguir\u00e1 cambiando y creciendo con cada actualizaci\u00f3n. El precio puede subir tras el acceso anticipado. Juego en ingl\u00e9s.", "short_description": "Sobrevive a doce oleadas brutales de soldados enmascarados, androides de combate, drones y m\u00e1quinas de guerra, con dos compa\u00f1eros a tu lado."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cover_landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1866276597840756", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835853_1866276601174089_6498523572710864975_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VkkoMZKvBEAQ7kNvwFPH1UZ&_nc_oc=AdpLksZ9iwkGR3Q6RGiW9tHgC7uThAX5xgTyL1b8Jxn-Q7Ob8BSPp0ObnZplltG56SQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRdxgZXW6yGFdLG2DvRHRk1EBEsuPtcY8W8pXdZePSE0Q&oe=6B0C7EF8"}, {"file_name": "hero_3000x900.png", "id": "1720119716297861", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835833_1720119719631194_3335104957312950388_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-KeUQ_F7prMQ7kNvwHEjK7R&_nc_oc=AdrTsDcC1c5ZkvLfhluamI6ohyXhy7WNWwPQzB54YIC6oQVuQxeYP-iy3HHrkuF5uJ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR-J9Xtk336rvC1DT1hbZrNxTBFyzrAYbZtrqCkvAws-Q&oe=6B0C61F1"}, {"file_name": "cover_square_1440x1440.png", "id": "1142453168778238", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835847_1142453172111571_3309743978505386960_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gSSzVwGtDdYQ7kNvwGNNliL&_nc_oc=Adr36eMVihRpX76dy8330JYHpQ-p8xwhwc0PIDkFrdq3lG4EitDv9D_mMuS28qUAnR8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTyfOCC3Bxwm2SBTQsDpFZFY5vJ1xXuPwTubQWMl0jsfA&oe=6B0C5528"}, {"file_name": "cover_portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "1138902222226598", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835857_1138902228893264_142694592665676556_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uxYl7zqZJbAQ7kNvwFVVTPR&_nc_oc=AdpxmGoMDuiWVO_ErIOI7OKIIltQ8VHXupvF-hmObGRwsylBVioZS1fmBmwGMngEkOA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSS2nBdNOluQZN2KcqOXAC-6_cGq8BdkTCjYxPkuk6clQ&oe=6B0C8288"}, {"file_name": "icon_512.png", "id": "1091086187138489", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596061819_1091086190471822_5339469222961502186_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6aTGA9SZQ3wQ7kNvwFGiEuW&_nc_oc=AdoAem_QiIYMONJIFqicsFoWRa3P7EFI_fe6o8BuD2iDgHHrcOy7qcovv0joEpO7-lw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ6tta-p5U5A1GMR7-LfCuGsCorN5ZlZYSEIqKJDjn0kw&oe=6B0C784F"}]}, "id": "1513952207462778", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "screenshot_1_promenade_fight.png", "id": "3074434009578733", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835816_3074434012912066_9191567722857852608_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CwWzXoV9Y2MQ7kNvwEe8DB2&_nc_oc=AdrW4cpIQvCL0We0JhDVJ80jJ_fVdoPqcCE6PthoLPo0D-TEVbVQPwKUhac_KoogFI4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSjBa-PWdMM4ilMW833mC53sNaoy46TbCZrXjYQArOoKg&oe=6B0C62CC"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_2_market_hall_fight.png", "id": "1124700713716603", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835817_1124700717049936_7566866171658914528_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XbgR-SpQG00Q7kNvwFkH20m&_nc_oc=AdobaicbiWVzi-L6La2g-SdwkkiSwVtyVCHL0_5n1TzZtLh4uwffoaRRU_4vDBC6ryA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTJUKiy4u66ANEsnVQJCqYqJMHW5_HTkfohvw8G8hYYxg&oe=6B0C6861"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_3_walker_under_fire.png", "id": "1404595068164126", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835853_1404595071497459_2202365357651674776_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8C0DlgXTr2gQ7kNvwFmr_nf&_nc_oc=AdqNYTI5LkHIfLDCes8keG7LDMetIyhtCq0fQhkGJE_T8Fv1zzFo2wLQtsi1wFBQYPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSMiR2biwoXJ5IcFYSQPVWnrrtwTqnhLR_7Df8Kt_3mrg&oe=6B0C7CA3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_4_bastion_turret_harbour.png", "id": "2151130845774965", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835830_2151130849108298_487731843194649614_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8NFNTKbrAxUQ7kNvwGEx5kf&_nc_oc=AdoGKUMW3lm_ayR-Tmd7tnRAcXrenIr7NS1nl5aN09btnkwWCCeARudm3gL_Lvl1bBM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ18UPzo8XFVnGb4bJGdYGCubAXlqW3UXkkKsv213Jwjw&oe=6B0C63BB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_5_ram_in_the_plaza.png", "id": "1004993022665857", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835811_1004993025999190_7968582929834445590_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d9lipNLtGK0Q7kNvwEUzmAO&_nc_oc=AdoMT9WvNWv4MWpyhzuSM7VkKn2RPCVwCg27GAx8F27d-ekaz6pkrCESjh3JBDwXP5I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRrTNi97825K84LMAMjuGTJxqmDBqcYd3ehf-fGQnIueg&oe=6B0C74F6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Levanter", "keywords": ["robots", "shooter", "survival", "fall", "futuristic"], "long_description": "The Mandate, a masked army that answers to no one, is taking the coast town by town. The last people are getting out of Prospera Bay. Someone has to hold the line until they are gone.\n\nLevanter is a hard, physical VR wave survival shooter. You and two squadmates hold your ground against twelve waves that hit harder every round. Survive them all.\n\nFIGHT WITH YOUR WHOLE BODY\n- A thermal rifle, carbine, SMG and shotgun, blaster pistols, a magnum and a sniper rifle. A light gun in each hand.\n- Raise an empty magnum or sniper rifle to reload, throw grenades, strike in melee on the move.\n- Jump, fire your jetpack and glide down from the rooftops.\n\nKNOW WHAT IS COMING\n- Masked soldiers take cover, pin you down and close in.\n- Robot hounds, drone swarms, walkers and heavy mechs strike from the streets and the sky.\n\nHOLD THE LINE\n- Earn credits with every kill and spend them at the command post between waves.\n- Build defences, man heavy guns, revive a fallen squadmate by taking their hand.\n- Four difficulties, from RECRUIT to LEGEND.\n\nCOMFORT\nSmooth locomotion, snap or smooth turning, seated or standing play, full field of view. Left-handed mode, subtitles, aim dot and steady aim.\n\nEARLY ACCESS\nLevanter is in active development. Today it has one map, Prospera Bay, and it will keep changing and growing with every update. The price may go up after Early Access. English only.", "short_description": "Survive twelve brutal waves of masked soldiers, robot hounds, drones and war machines, with two squadmates at your side."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://raetae.com/levanter/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Raetae Studios", "support_website_url": "https://raetae.com/support/", "website_url": "https://raetae.com/levanter/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "29258809760405347"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835847_1142453172111571_3309743978505386960_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gSSzVwGtDdYQ7kNvwGNNliL&_nc_oc=Adr36eMVihRpX76dy8330JYHpQ-p8xwhwc0PIDkFrdq3lG4EitDv9D_mMuS28qUAnR8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQw5LHoPoydOUlYlBEQqftejGqMwe4PmzJE6OIJx8TQBA&oe=6B0C5528"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Levanter", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Shooter", "id": "3744040075834813"}, {"topic_name": "Action", "id": "459781504968480"}, {"topic_name": "Survival", "id": "644354873106712"}], "release_date": 1795456980, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "29007754712177521", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "29007754548844204", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1499579856565179"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1844754896775865", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Levanter", "keywords": ["oleadas", "shooter", "robots", "drones", "mechas"], "long_description": "El Mandato, un ej\u00e9rcito enmascarado que no responde ante nadie, toma la costa pueblo a pueblo. Los \u00faltimos vecinos huyen y alguien debe aguantar la l\u00ednea hasta que se vayan.\n\nLevanter es un shooter VR de supervivencia por oleadas, duro y f\u00edsico. T\u00fa y dos compa\u00f1eros resist\u00eds doce oleadas cada vez m\u00e1s duras. Sobrevive a todas.\n\nLUCHA CON TODO EL CUERPO\n- Fusiles, carabinas y subfusiles t\u00e9rmicos, escopeta, lanza de carga y magnum. Un arma ligera en cada mano.\n- Recarga alzando el arma, lanza granadas y golpea cuerpo a cuerpo en movimiento.\n- Salta, enciende el jetpack y planea desde las azoteas.\n\nCONOCE LO QUE VIENE\n- Soldados enmascarados que se cubren, te inmovilizan y te flanquean.\n- Androides de combate, perros robot, enjambres de drones, caminantes y mechas pesados llegan por tierra y aire.\n\nAGUANTA LA POSICI\u00d3N\n- Gana cr\u00e9ditos con cada baja y g\u00e1stalos en el centro de control entre oleadas.\n- Levanta defensas, usa armas pesadas y reanima a un compa\u00f1ero ca\u00eddo cogi\u00e9ndole de la mano.\n- Cuatro dificultades, de RECRUIT a LEGEND.\n\nCOMODIDAD\nMovimiento libre, giro por pasos o continuo, sentado o de pie, campo de visi\u00f3n completo. Modo zurdo, subt\u00edtulos, punto de mira y punter\u00eda estable.\n\nACCESO ANTICIPADO\nLevanter est\u00e1 en pleno desarrollo y seguir\u00e1 cambiando y creciendo con cada actualizaci\u00f3n. El precio puede subir tras el acceso anticipado. Juego en ingl\u00e9s.", "short_description": "Sobrevive a doce oleadas brutales de soldados enmascarados, androides de combate, drones y m\u00e1quinas de guerra, con dos compa\u00f1eros a tu lado."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cover_landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1866276597840756", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835853_1866276601174089_6498523572710864975_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc